  "instructions": [
    "Wash and dry all vegetables.",
    "Dice the cucumber and cut the cherry tomatoes in halves.",
    "Thinly slice the red onion.",
    "Finely chop the dill, parsley, and mint and set aside.",
    "In a small bowl whisk together olive oil, red wine vinegar, lemon juice, salt, and pepper to make the vinaigrette.",
    "Place the drained tuna in a large mixing bowl and gently flake it with a fork.",
    "Add the diced cucumber, halved cherry tomatoes, and thinly sliced onion to the bowl.",
    "Pour the vinaigrette over the salad and toss gently to combine.",
    "Fold in the chopped herbs and give a final light toss.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning with more salt or pepper if needed.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature, garnished with extra mint if desired."
